**Issue**: #396
**Date**: 2026-09-14
**Status**: Approved
**Author**: NMG
**Related Spec**: specs/372-restore-bounded-operator-authorized-recovery-of-stopped-delivery/

Feature: Investigate closed exclusive implement failures without replay
  A closed exclusive implement worker may leave valid committed work beyond the checkpoint.
  Parameter-free execute resumes only the remaining approved work once.

  @AC1 @regression
  Scenario: Discover a safe exclusive implement resume without mutation
    Given implement failed after an exclusive worker advanced the issue branch from checkpoint HEAD to a descendant HEAD
    And workers are empty and the unique incomplete owner id equals the run id
    When recovery discovery runs
    Then it reports loop-recovery-available with class exclusive_implement_resume
    And checkpoint handoff and safe-recovery bytes are unchanged

  @AC2 @regression
  Scenario: Consume and dispatch exclusive resume once
    Given exclusive implement resume is discoverable
    When parameter-free execute acquires the controller lease
    Then it re-proves and archives the failed handoff
    And it consumes one exclusive_implement_resume record
    And it advances run HEAD to current HEAD and clears failed and remediation state
    And exactly sN-implement starts with the exclusive resume prompt

  @AC3 @regression
  Scenario: Resume prompt investigates before editing
    Given an exclusive implement resume worker is started
    When it reads its prompt
    Then it maps every tasks acceptance bullet to satisfied remaining-authorized or still-blocked before editing
    And it does not re-implement satisfied work
    And it does not reset rebase or discard current HEAD
    And it does not repeat a prerequisite still forbidden by the current owner-bound probe

  @AC4 @regression
  Scenario: Repaired publication keeps ordinary implement behavior
    Given checkpoint and checkout HEAD are exact and only tasks Files spelling was repaired
    When recovery is discovered and consumed
    Then the class remains repaired_publication_intervention
    And ordinary implement starts without the exclusive resume header

  @AC5 @regression
  Scenario: Unsafe exclusive recovery remains blocked
    Given the branch is wrong or a worker is live or current HEAD is not a checkpoint descendant or the owner is missing
    When recovery is evaluated
    Then no recovery is available
    And no worker starts

  @AC6 @regression
  Scenario: Explicit verification report create is writable
    Given implement tasks list the exact issue verification-report path with operation Create
    When publication scope is inspected
    Then the report path is tracked writable and allowed
    And the report path is not read-only
    And the four approved spec inputs remain read-only

  @AC7 @regression
  Scenario: Consumed failed resume cannot replay
    Given exclusive implement resume was consumed and its worker wrote another failed implement handoff
    When parameter-free execute runs again
    Then recovery is consumed rather than available
    And no second worker starts
